        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The purpose of this letter is to confirm that the parties have agreed to form an Adjustment Assistance Committee consisting of management and Union officers (in equal numbers). The Committee will be responsible for developing an Adjustment Assistance Program and recommending same to management for final approval by no later than September 1, 1998.",
